{
  "id": "E275",
  "title": "Steamed Buns for Breakfast",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-11-22",
  "synopsis": "Steamed buns are probably the most popular breakfast choice in China.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/913/311ee2d2434fd29ec75035ea0226bb4c2dbcc29b.mp3?1542078297",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我要两个包子\n\n本：老板你好！我要两个包子。\n老板：没问题，要什么馅儿的？\n本：要一个肉包和一个菜包吧。多少钱？\n老板：3块钱。",
    "traditional": "我要兩個包子\n\n本：老闆你好！我要兩個包子。\n老闆：沒問題，要什麼餡兒的？\n本：要一個肉包和一個菜包吧。多少錢？\n老闆：3塊錢。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I Want Two Steamed Buns"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：老板你好！我要两个包子。",
      "traditional": "本：老闆你好！我要兩個包子。",
      "pinyin": "běn lǎo bǎn nǐ hǎo wǒ yào liǎng ge bāo zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello, shop owner! Please give me two steamed buns."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老板：没问题，要什么馅儿的？",
      "traditional": "老闆：沒問題，要什麼餡兒的？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn méi wèn tí yào shén me xiàn'r de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop owner: No problem. What filling do you want?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：要一个肉包和一个菜包吧。多少钱？",
      "traditional": "本：要一個肉包和一個菜包吧。多少錢？",
      "pinyin": "běn yào yí ge ròu bāo hé yí ge cài bāo ba duō shao qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: One with meat and one with vegetables. How much is it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老板：3块钱。",
      "traditional": "老闆：3塊錢。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn 1 kuài qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop owner: 3 yuan."
    }
  ],
